		"MASTER / PIANO: Master level, Piano A, Piano B, Piano select, Piano timbre, KB touch",
		"PROGRAM / SYNTH: Program display, Program dial, Synth A, Synth B, Attack, Release",
		"EFFECTS: Mod 1 rate, Mod 1 amount, Mod 2 rate, Mod 2 amount, Delay mix, Delay feedback, Reverb mix, Compressor amount"
	],
	"notice": "Set the global MIDI channel and Local Control as needed for DAW routing. The dedicated five-pin Triple Pedal 2 connector must not be confused with MIDI IN/OUT. This model has no pitch stick or modulation wheel. Match the instrument MIDI channel and receive filters before sending notes or CCs. USB carries MIDI/data rather than audio; connect the audio outputs separately. Consult the download page for the correct Windows USB driver. Port aliases have not been verified on hardware; select the profile manually. The drawings are selected-control schematics rather than scale panel plans. Keyboard and panel controls remain unbound; splits, octave shifts and layer routing can change their behavior. Only the listed CCs are supplied, not the full MIDI implementation.",
